    {
      "id": "claim_971c67bb87764763a7394fe3d5438730",
      "statement": "ironclaw_safety detects and redacts prompt injections, credential leaks, and sensitive paths before they cross trust boundaries. The Sanitizer uses bounded linear-time regexes (no ReDoS), the LeakDetector finds known credential formats and host paths without returning raw values, and model input redaction applies infallible transforms before prompts enter the model.",
