      "id": "claim_6605cfce3c2f48bba66e69a9d2d10cbb",
      "statement": "ironclaw_runtime_policy is the only sanctioned producer of EffectiveRuntimePolicy; resolution is deterministic with equal inputs producing equal outputs, monotonically safe (org policy may reduce authority never increase), and fail-closed (invalid deployment-profile pairs rejected not silently downgraded).",
