    {
      "id": "claim_8549f2085d104dac8a71aaada4453c10",
      "statement": "Resource governance enforces reserve-execute-reconcile protocol: no costed or quota-limited work executes without an active reservation, reservation failure is a denial never a reason to proceed, and every scope (tenant, user, project, agent, thread) is nested and independent.",
