    {
      "id": "claim_2e3e099ae8ed4faf91c46e2257c2e7b2",
      "statement": "The sandbox lane uses advisory owner locks on workspace root to prevent cross-process cleanup races, active-exec accounting to prevent idle sweeper from stopping containers with active commands, and managed egress suspension that removes proxy containers but retains stopped workers' private networks and host-side CA/key material to preserve container identity across wake-up.",
