      "id": "claim_4a7a86fa92964ff39f279a629d907cd9",
      "statement": "Approval is fail-closed with ordered persistence: the approval authority record is persisted before the lease is issued; if the lease store fails after approval is persisted, the request stays Approved and the caller surfaces the lease error, never rolling back to Pending.",
