      "statement": "The MCP server sandbox lane (ironclaw_mcp) runs Model Context Protocol servers as sandboxed processes with the same Docker isolation and credential firewall as the process sandbox, communicates over JSON-RPC stdin/stdout, and validates and filters tools by caller grant before invocation.",
